                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Telegram From the American Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">Dated November 11,
                        1942, to Mohammed Idris El Senussi </hi>
                </head>
                <p>In acknowledging your telegram of November 2 in which you were good enough to
                    express your confidence in the success of the cause of the United Nations I
                    convey to Your Eminence an expression of sincere appreciation.</p>
            </div>
